 to use it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_3","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_20","text":"No kidding! This is fun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_21","text":"What about you, Denji? Power?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_22","text":"I like this one!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_23","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_23","text":"Power chooses a rocket launcher almost as tall as her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_24","text":"I'll go for this one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_25","text":"Are there any weapons left for me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_26","text":"No, I'm afraid that was all of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_3","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_28","text":"There are plenty of ways you could help us that don't involve a weapon. You could be our backup, how does that sound?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_29","text":"Sounds like I don't have much of a choice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_30","text":"Commander, we're all done here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_31","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_31","text":"Then let's commence the reconnaissance mission.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_32","text":"Roger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_33","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_33","text":"On the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CityForest_02","bgArt":"cityforest_02","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_34","text":"Man, what a desolate place...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_distress","movie":null,"shown":["neon","anis","rapi","c_npc_2","c_3","c_npc_1","c_2"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_35","text":"The surface has been ravaged by Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_3","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_36","text":"Okay, I've been wondering for a while now: What exactly is a 'Rapture'?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_37","text":"Raptures detected up ahead. Within engagement distance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_3","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_38","text":"Guess I'll get to see for myself soon enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_03_s_39","text":"Trust me, you'll get to see plenty of them from here on out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_03_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"